Z||000007||Gokart||05-02-2000||08:54 PM||||Enough smart members here made me think twice when I was looking for scoops for my GT like the ones I had on my 2M4 5 years back. I remember taking a non-mechanics advice when I pulled the thermostat to keep from overheating <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> The natural flow of air comes up from the bottom and OUT the grills. Forcing air down the grills doesn't sound like a good idea to me now matter how good the scoops look.<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 05-02-2000).]||||reg||4
